<<show_character "jushi">>

<<wait 0.3>>

Hou: Miss! Miss!

Hou: I need a lifesaver here, right now!

Hou: Quick! Find me a teapot I can give my son's girlfriend when I meet her family!

Me: Huh?

Hou: Oh, don't dawdle. Come here!

Hou: Dinner starts at 5:30. They're probably already on their way to play guandan before that.

(She clicks her tongue.)

(The same woman with shoulder-length hair, her head still slightly bowed...)

//Pause the dialogue panel here; press Space to show it again.

<<pause_dialogue>>

Me: Oh, of course. Have a look through the catalog. Everything here is in stock.

(You hurriedly hand her the catalog. She practically snatches it with one hand.)

//Pause the dialogue panel here; press Space to show it again.

<<pause_dialogue>>

Me: I'll get the box and gift bag ready while you tell me what you're looking for. Then we can choose a pot together.

Hou: What is there to tell? (She clicks her tongue.)

Hou: The girl's from Chongqing. She did her bachelor's in electrical and electronic engineering here in China, and she's going abroad for grad school.

Hou: She'll be studying with my son.

Hou: Oh, I don't know much else.

Me: Haha, it's the first meeting. I imagine everyone's nervous. Try to relax.

Me: You're such a gracious person. Meeting you is bound to make your son look good in her eyes.

Hou: Mm.

(Neither of you speaks for a while.)

//Pause the dialogue panel here; press Space to show it again.

<<pause_dialogue>>

<<jump JushiD2_FirstSilence>>

