    Me: Oh, the Heritage Collection.

    Hou: Those two from Boudoir Charms weren't bad either.

    Hou: Forget the lovebirds. They're already on opposite sides of the world. If they fly any farther, I'll never see him again.

    Hou: The peach one was nice, though. Round and rather sweet.

    Narrator: (She smiles gently at you.)

    Hou: Don't rule those teapots out just because I said a few things.

<<elseif $D2TriedFamily or $D2TriedWelcome>>

