title: JushiD2_HeHuanHistory

position: 351,462

---

Me: As a scholar-official himself, he often worked with artisan siblings to design and commission zisha teapots,

Me: and even inscribed them himself. The teapot became both a medium and an artistic object.

[You hear the Courtesan calling.]

Hou: (Biting her lip.) And what does that have to do with tonight?

Me: Right, right.

<<jump JushiD2_HeHuanStory>>

===



title: JushiD2_HeHuanStory

position: 666,687

---

Me: The story goes that while Mansheng was serving as an official in Liyang, he was responsible for transporting Baiya tribute tea to the capital.

Me: The tea arrived on time, the emperor was pleased, and Mansheng held a banquet for his friends to celebrate.

Me: Drums thundered, gongs rang, and firecrackers went off.

Me: Delighted, he jumped right in, grabbed two big cymbals, and clashed them open and shut.

Me: As the story puts it: "Amid banquet music, he himself took up the great cymbals."

Me: That's what inspired him to design the Harmony Teapot.

Hou: (Laughing.) A county magistrate himself banging away at cymbals?

Hou: Now that's someone with spirit, unconcerned with appearances.

[You hear yourself calling for Lü Meng.]

Me: See how the two halves of the body fit together, like two cymbals pressed against each other?

(Still talking, you take out the lenticular card and hand it to Hou.

While she handles it and compares the images, you turn toward the display cabinet and scan the shelves for the teapot.)

//Pause the dialogue panel here; press Space to show it again.

<<pause_dialogue>>

(Found it! You put it in front of Hou.)

Me: And I think, as a gift tonight, it doesn't have to mean just marital harmony.

Me: Friends, relatives, even people who hardly know one another—getting to sit down at the same table is a good thing in itself.

Me: It can wish someone success in their career and celebrate the joy of gathering together, without being too obscure.

Hou: Quite. People have different views and different positions. They have to sit down together before they can even begin to talk about harmony.

(She presses her lips together.)

Hou: I like that story.

<<jump JushiD2_HeHuanConfirm>>

